==Battleground==
*5 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Star Peng]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Spacefish Jones]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**2 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the insane buffs on the Starred Aliens, it is basically required to have all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] before attempting this stage.

Use multiple meatshields that are able to solidly stall the enemies, use proc units such as [[Seafarer Cat]] or [[Corrupted Psychocat]] that are able to freeze/slow the enemies well enough, and use units such as [[Can Can Cat]], [[Courier Cat]], etc. that can rush down the enemies before they reach the base in this stage.

